sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as DocumentsController
    participant MinIO as MinIO
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Queue as BackgroundJobQueue
    participant Worker as BackgroundJobService

    Client->>API: POST /api/documents (Datei)
    API->>MinIO: Datei speichern
    MinIO-->>API: Speicher-Pfad
    API->>DB: Document-Metadaten anlegen
    API->>Queue: Indexing-Job einreihen
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted (sofort)

    Note over Worker: Asynchron im Hintergrund
    Queue-->>Worker: Job aus Queue dequeuen
    Worker->>MinIO: Datei laden
    MinIO-->>Worker: Datei-Bytes
    Worker->>Worker: Text extrahieren und chunken
    Worker->>DB: DocumentChunks und Embeddings speichern
    Worker->>DB: Document.IsIndexed = true
